  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ef87e16d72b0596bd32d34b9db05576a27002727.png\" alt=\"Enchantrax Title\"></p>\n<p><strong>Enchantrax 为 Minecraft 中的附魔带来了全新的体验，通过为每本书提供独特的视觉效果，让你更容易识别所需的附魔。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&lt;details open=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;附魔百科&lt;/summary&gt;\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a648cc947bd80b36a73a7e52128282c8a6c98f7.png\" alt=\"ORE BADGES\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a3c0af74d807ff09521dbfcf97ea3dfb8201e232.png\" alt=\"Fortune\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/31e1997968aee7bd4ac4b8750330575c4e056e3e.png\" alt=\"Density\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/66b74100749efed2e4b04b0440525271b46f8341.png\" alt=\"Bane of Arthropods\"></p>\n&lt;/details&gt;\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>你能仅凭一张图片识别每种附魔吗？</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/57ff6e3c64174512fbd2a81baad2e6d22154a8e4.png\" alt=\"Can you identify each enchantment just by ONE Image?\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h4>&bull; 资源包由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fMarkiS_arts\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Markis_ArtS</a> 制作</h4>",
